# A creature that attacked is no longer attacking after combat, so Morale cast in the postcombat main phase does not pump it (CR 511.3).
[Bot1 Deck]
Ornithopter
Black Lotus
Morale
Plains x17
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
[T3 Bot1.BeginCombat]
Bot1.Attack(Ornithopter > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Hand.Morale.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 2
